    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Once again, we've arrived at a critical turning point. And last time\u2026 Babel met the fate I dreaded most."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It turns out that I can't make sure everything is running on its ideal track, Mon3tr."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "npc_10002",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr",
        "text": "(Raises claw)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr",
        "text": "(Rubs gently)"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Our own limitations have begun to affect our usefulness in more important endeavors."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We may be able to witness the changes of the stars and the untamed cosmos, but when faced with a real crisis, we're no different from any other creatures on this great land."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "npc_10002",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr",
        "text": "(Dissatisifed growl)"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#11$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Thank you for comforting me. I can sense your good intentions."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "npc_10002",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr",
        "text": "(Anxious growl)"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Yes, I suppose Amiya and the Doctor have already begun preparing to delve deeper into Civilight Eterna."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I will not interfere with Amiya's decision. She is mature enough to make the most correct judgment."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "And the Doctor... the Doctor isn't quite the same anymore either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Maybe I still have a glimmer of hope in my heart. Maybe, this time the outcome will be different."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "npc_10002",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr",
        "text": "(Subdued bow)"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "It is true that my own sanity is constantly warning me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Touching the Doctor's mind again with the help of Civilight Eterna is not a sound decision, but Amiya is right, we don't have much choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$Mon3tr_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
