        "text": "At this moment, Mon3tr can sense even Kal'tsit's slightest emotions."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since Kal'tsit's latest awakening, Mon3tr has been at her side."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mon3tr is her companion, the symbiote she personally guides... and more importantly, herself."
